      "title": "\u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 Z-Image Turbo FP8 Split \u2014 Text to Image",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 Z-Image Turbo FP8 Split \u2014 Text to Image\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 UNETLoader\n**Model:** `z-image-turbo_fp8_scaled_e5m2_KJ.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/z-image/`\n> Kijai fp8 scaled variant \u2014 ~6 GB\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 CLIPLoader\n**Model:** `qwen_3_4b.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/`\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 VAELoader\n**Model:** `ae.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udde9 Required Custom Nodes\n- None \u2014 all core nodes\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips\n- Official Qwen3-4B text encoder by default. Optional uncensored community encoders: set `APEXFORGE_UNCENSORED_ENCODERS=true` in the pod's environment variables, restart, then pick them in the text encoder loader\n- Split-file version gives more control over individual components\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcda ApexForge by Alex Harte\n\ud83c\udf10 **Guides & updates:** https://alexanderharte.com\n\ud83d\ude80 **All models are pre-installed on your pod.**\n\ud83c\udfa8 **Just load this workflow and start generating.**"
      ],
      "color": "#231535",
      "bgcolor": "#3f2460"
    }
